spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">) 18:00</span>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">주말 및 공휴일 포함 신청기간 내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;24</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">시간 신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">마감일 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">장학금 신청은 한국장학재단 누리집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(www.kosaf.go.kr)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">또는 모바일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(App)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">에서 학생이 직접 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">제출서류는 장학금 신청 시작일 기준 최근&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">개월&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">이내 발급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">발급처&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;\">직인 및 페이지 전체 확인 가능한 서류 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학생 신청 관련 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">한국장학재단 상담센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(1599-2290)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">로 문의</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 중복수혜:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">’25</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">년 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">학기 푸른등대 기부장학금은 모두 생활비 장학금으로 학자금 중복지원 범위에 포함되지 않음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt;\">- 단, 푸른등대삼성기부장학금과 동일학기 중복 수혜 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-s